# Object-Oriented Library Manager

## Description

A simple C++ library management system developed using
Object-Oriented Programming concepts.

## Features

- Add books
- Display book details
- Borrow books
- Return books
- Check book availability

## OOP Concepts Used

- Classes and Objects
- Encapsulation
- Constructors
- Private and Public members
- Vectors
- Member functions

## Files

- `library_manager.h` - Class declarations
- `library_manager.cpp` - Class implementations
- `main.cpp` - Main program

## How to Run

Compile the program using:

```bash
g++ main.cpp library_manager.cpp -o library_manager
